title: "AI-Based Portable Fundus Camera and Analysing Unit for Diabetic Retinopathy Screening"
abstract: "A low-cost, offline fundus camera built on a Raspberry Pi 5 with a 20 D condensing lens and NoIR camera, a quality and fundus-image gate, and an EfficientNet-B0 grader trained on APTOS 2019 (test QWK 0.877; referable-DR sensitivity 93.7 %, specificity 90.8 %)."
